window.products.push({"id":1154061,"name":"Garment Steamer Ironing Glove, Portable Handheld Mini Steam Ironing Board, Waterproof Anti Steam Mitt with Finger Loop, Heat Resistant Complete Care P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PMOPFPmGL._AC_SL1005_.jpg","description":"Insulated & Waterproof & Breathable Fabric: Garment steamer ironing glove uses the high temperature resistant & anti-scalding and waterproof polyester. There is a thick sponge inside for effective heat insulation, and the waterproof surface isolates the moisture. The breathable mesh design keeps your hand dry and prevents sweating after long time use. In a word, The glove gives you a safe and comfortable experience. Finger loop design & Comprehensive protection: The handheld ironing glove have a built-in finger loop which can help you handle the glove easily. And its large internal space prevents the penetration of steam effectively. It gives your hand and wrist comprehensive protection. It also can be used as a mini ironing board to help you iron your clothes more smoothly. You can hold the steam iron in one hand and the glove in the other hand, which is convenient and makes the clothes neater. Multi-functional & Wide Application: The heat resistant glove is designed for all steam irons, such as fabric steamer, garment steamer, handheld garment steamer, travel garment steamer, vertical fabric steamer, small ironing table rack, etc. Unlimited use of both hands and it is perfect for all types of garments and clothes. It helps to smoothly iron shirts, coats, jackets, T-shirts, etc. In particular, it makes ironing collars, sleeves, pockets, etc. much easier and faster. Lightweight & Universal size: The size of steam glove is 9.5x5.5x1inch and it is suitable for most people. Its weight is 0.06 lbs and it is portable. The ironing glove is practical for everyday use at home and working on trips. A good choice as a gift: You can send the garment steamer ironing glove to your friends, neighbours and family members as a nice gift.Especially for wife and mother, it is a great gift. (Gift bag/ Gift box is not included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PMOPFPmGL._AC_SL1005_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jinsihou","source_asin":"B0B31Z2RNZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1154061","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B31Z2RNZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B31Z2RNZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
