window.products.push({"id":1154376,"name":"Gooseneck Kettle - Harriet 37oz (1.1L) Pour Over Kettle with Thermometer - Coffee Kettle for Stove Top with Anti-Hot Handle, Flow Spout Design For Dri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tGaR87m1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE THREE-LAYER BASE DESIGN: Compared with other pour-over coffee kettles that have only one or two metal layers on the bottom, our kettle has a unique three-layer base design to keep your kettle leak-free and rust-free for years, which can provide uniform heat circulation and rapid boiling, which is more heat-preserving than a single-layer base pot. BUILT-IN THERMOMETER: For outstanding coffee and tea taste you need the best thermometer you can get.The built-in thermometer allows you to pour coffee at the optimal temperature (195-205°F) to extract the full flavor and aroma. Smooth water flow is essential in making drip coffee and pour over tea. The 90°radian can help you precisely control the speed of the water flow to achieve precise pour. HOT-RESISTANT & ERGONOMIC ANTI HOT RESIN HANDLE: This aesthetic and ergonomic designed pour over kettle adopts heat-resistant resin handle and an additional heat insulation mat, allows you to hold the coffee kettle with your bare hands without risking burns. The ergonomic shape makes you more comfortable when lifting, pouring and filling water, ensuring that the coffee kettle will not slip. The unique wood pattern design of the handle decorates your kitchen. SAFE TO USE: This coffee kettle uses professional food-grade materials and 304 stainless steel technology, which is rust-free, easy to clean, and quick to heat up. BPA-free. Keep and wash it carefully and you will always get a smooth bottom! This stovetop kettle is suitable for gas, electric, induction, halogen and radiant stoves. The kettles can hold 1.1 liters / 37 ounces of water, it is best to add to the maximum water level at the \"MAX\" of the kettle. WORRY-FREE PURCHASE: Please use this tea kettle over small or medium heat. Harriet is committed to providing our consumers with the absolute best value and quality in our entire product range. All our products have a full 12-month warranty. If you have any questions about Harriet pour over coffee kettle, please feel free to contact us, we will try our best to solve the problem for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tGaR87m1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"harriet","source_asin":"B0946HB6ZW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1154376","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0946HB6ZW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0946HB6ZW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
