window.products.push({"id":1154414,"name":"Veratex 100% Cotton Velvet Modern & Elegant Tailored Grommet Window Valance Curtain Made in The USA, Blue Smoke","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J2zlDQerL._AC_SL1086_.jpg","description":"The Veratex grommet window valances measure 17\" x 50\" and require assembly upon delivery. Each valance curtain is proudly manufactured in the U.S.A. from soft and luxurious, 100% cotton velvet. This grommet window valance features a uniquely elegant and stunning design that possesses the capability of reinvigorating the general decor of any bedroom or living room and effectively creates a deeper level of sophistication. Each classic cotton velvet window valance is available in a variety of magnificent color shades including blue smoke, apple cider, pebble, berry, silver and juniper. The flawlessly tasteful union of quality design with beautiful coloring ensures a seamless portrayal of quality and fashion. Veratex is a true leader in the industry of sophisticated and divine textiles. They take pride in cherishing a unique and elegant vision that proudly embraces intricately woven designs, stylish color tones and soft, luxurious textures to create classic yet stunningly magnificent products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61J2zlDQerL._AC_SL1086_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Veratex","source_asin":"B073CGV2HM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1154414","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073CGV2HM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073CGV2HM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1154415,"name":"Trenton Gifts Clear Cap Storage Case. Holds 24 Caps. 23\" x 6\" x 8\". Clear Plastic Black Handles. Box with Zipper Closure. Dirt & Dust Protection","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41peuWG5ObL._AC_.jpg","description":"Hats literally come in all shapes and sizes. But one thing each style has in common is that they amass and amass quickly. Finding enough space to store your collection can often be a chore. Our storage bag gives you the luxury of keeping up to 24 hats in one central location. Made from clear protective plastic, our bag keeps your hats safe from dust, dirt and moisture. Each bag comes with a wrap-around zippered top and dual nylon webbed handles for easy access and portability. The bag’s thick bottom base makes it easy to stack each bag on top of the other for even greater space-saving storage. Once you have filled the bag to your liking, it will sit steadily on any shelving unit, in your closet, atop your dresser, underneath your bed, or wherever you prefer to keep your storage bags.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41peuWG5ObL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trenton Gifts","source_asin":"B07HM7WCFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1154415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HM7WCFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HM7WCFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
