window.products.push({"id":1154417,"name":"Craig Bachman Mr and Mrs Claus in Camper Snow Globe - 11.25 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kTROw2DdL._AC_.jpg","description":"Santa has traded his sleigh for a camper in order to get a much needed rest after the holidays! The lit backdrop depicts Mr. and Mrs. Claus enjoying a meal together in a cozy cabin like setting. Place this snow globe in a family room or den where it can be often seen. It may serve as a gentle reminder that we could all use a little rest after the holidays!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kTROw2DdL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Craig Bachman","source_asin":"B08LC1BPKF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1154417","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LC1BPKF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LC1BPKF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
