window.products.push({"id":1154499,"name":"ArtSocket 4 Pcs Shower Curtain Set Cute Green Cactus Desert Summer Kids Hipster Houseplant Abstract Vintage with Non-Slip Rugs Toilet Lid Cover and Ba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81b06Gc4xIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Premium Bathroom Accessories]: Our shower curtain is made of high-quality polyester fabric, ensuring excellent waterproof performance. The anti-slip bathroom rugs and mats set feature soft, comfortable polyurethane memory foam filling, and a cozy coral velvet microfiber outer material that's skin-friendly, relieving pressure and fatigue on your feet. The non-slip shower carpets and bath rugs are equipped with PVC dots on the bottom to prevent shifting and skidding, ensuring your safety. [The Shower Curtain Set Includes]: The waterproof shower curtain measures 72\"L x 72\"W, while the plush bathroom mat is 23.6\"L x 15.7\"W. The set also includes an o-toilet cover (16.5\"L x 14.6\"W) and a U-shaped rug (17.7\"L x 15.8\"W), all designed to fit most standard-sized bathrooms. [Effortless Installation]: Our bathroom set comes with 12 complimentary, sturdy hooks, making installation a breeze. The shower curtain features 12 reinforced grommets for easy hanging, while the non-slip bath mat and toilet lid cover ensure safety and comfort. [Elevate Your Bathroom Decor]: Thanks to the yellow abstract stylish shower curtain by ArtSocket you can create a relaxing & harmonious bathing atmosphere, while also adding an eye-catching decor piece to your bathroom interior. This stylish 4-piece bathroom set is perfect for your home, motel, hotel, or dormitory.Happy bath times ahead! [Absolutely Easy Care]: For all-time relaxing moments at home! Fully unwind during a lovely bath or shower and enjoy your peace of mind knowing that the Bathroom Sets with Shower Curtain and Rugs are conveniently machine washable in cold water - time-saving and hassle-free, what’s not to love?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81b06Gc4xIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtSocket","source_asin":"B0C4TFPRJP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1154499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4TFPRJP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4TFPRJP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1154500,"name":"LunchFox Eco-Friendly Insulated Neoprene Lunch Bag Tote for Women, Pink/Red - The Melrose","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715-24YkIuL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Eat smart like a fox! Here’s how: Keep your food colder (or warmer) longer! LunchFox insulated lunch bags for women are made with ultra-thick 5mm neoprene for 4-6 hrs of insulating action. No more warm drinks or wilted salads! Neoprene provides more than thermal insulation, it also cushions the contents of your women’s insulated lunch tote from damage, and it’s waterproof. Easily pack all of your lunch items! Our soft, supple neoprene expands to accommodate food containers of all shapes and sizes , beverages, fruit, snacks, and reusable ice packs. The main compartment measures 8”H x 12”W x 6”D. The exterior pocket dimensions are 7 ¾”H x 7”W x 1”D. Embrace beautiful design! LunchFox insulated lunch bags for women not only function better but also bring our signature LA style to an otherwise mundane object. We’ve agonized over every detail and component so you can enjoy a higher quality and impossibly cute lunch bag for women (teens and girls too!). The Melrose women’s lunch bag evokes the feeling of browsing boutique fashion shops along one of LA’s most iconic streets - Melrose avenue. Bring a bit of that feeling with you to the office, the teachers' lounge, the nurses' station, or wherever life takes you! Make a difference! A reusable, eco-friendly lunch bag helps reduce waste. We encourage you to think about what you put in your bag: Whenever possible, choose fresh organic non-GMO produce, support local farms and vendors, and consider switching to a plant-based diet. Lunch tastes better when you love our planet! We support Mercy for Animals in the mission to end farm animal abuse. When you purchase a LunchFox product a portion of the proceeds will be donated to Mercy for Animals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715-24YkIuL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LunchFox","source_asin":"B01MU15PES","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1154500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MU15PES","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MU15PES","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
