window.products.push({"id":1154539,"name":"FAWLES Oversized Wine Glasses, Large Red Wine Glasses Set of 4, 28 oz Crystal Wine Glasses, Large Burgundy Wine Glasses for Home Restaurant Use","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l1D50Py1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HOLD AN ENTIRE 750ML BOTTLE OF WINE: Each of our extra large wine glasses holds up to 28 oz of red or white wine or your favourite beverage. They are ideal for themed drink parties or casual entertainment. Thanks to the unique pulled stem, these wine glasses are durable enough for everyday use. PROFESSIONAL WINE GLASSES FOR WINE TASTING: Recommended by Chefs and Sommelier! The wide opening of the glass bowl is perfect to allow the tannins of the wine to breathe. The beautiful shape allows the aroma of the wine to hit the nose as we sip. The carefully cut ultra thin rim directs the wine to the center of the tongue, creating a harmony of the rich fruit flavors and acidity. EXQUISITE DESIGN CERTAINLY IMPRESS EVERYONE: Classic Burgundy wine glasses are suitable for drinking lighter, more delicate red wines such as Pinot Noir, Beaujolais, red Burgundy, and Dolcetto. Each of our wine glasses is made from non-leaded Crystal that provides our wine glasses extreme clarity and sparkle. With classic design and elegant lines, these stemmed wine glasses will absolutely impress everyone. EXCELLENT GIFT FOR YOUR FRIENDS: Each set contains 4 pieces oversize wine glasses. The large red wine glass is also elegant enough to serve at fancy cocktail parties when sharing among friends. Our oversized wine glasses can hold a large capacity of your favorite wine, champagne, or cocktail. This wine glass set makes an excellent birthday, holiday or housewarming gift for any wine enthusiasts. EASY CARE & ONE-YEAR NO QUESTION ASKED ON OUR WINE GLASSES: Dishwasher safe, please put the wine glass on the top rack of the dishwasher. We stand behind all of our high-quality products so we offer a ONE-YEAR No Question Asked on all our wine glasses set. Please contact us and we will be pleased to assist you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61l1D50Py1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FAWLES","source_asin":"B09Q14WBFV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1154539","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q14WBFV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q14WBFV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
