window.products.push({"id":1154594,"name":"COLZER 10,000 BTU Portable Air Conditioner for 400 Sq Ft 3-in-1 Portable AC Unit with Remote Control for Large Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DV4W2iPjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mighty Cooling Power: The COLZER portable air conditioner offers 10,000 BTUs of cool air for wide application rooms, thanks to its superior inbuilt compressor. It cools down your living room, bedroom, dorm, apartment or office in a few minutes, keeping you and your family cool and comfortable instantly. High Air Flow: With the maximum airflow of 350 m³/h, this portable ac circulates the room air efficiently. It also features 2 fan speeds (high and low) with an auto mode to satisfy your needs. Better Air Circulation: The oscillating louvers of the air conditioner portable help evenly distribute cool air to every corner of your room to circulate your room air. Almost all year round Comfort: The air conditioner for room portable is a highly versatile machine. Cool mode can quickly cool the room in hot days with fast cool down, dry mode can remove moisture in muddy rainy days with 55 pints/day, fan mode can circulate air in not-that-hot days with 2 speed. 2 Control Methods: A simple, clear control panel allows you to easily set the mode, fan speed, timer, and swing direction of this portable air conditioning unit. For extra convenience, the portable air conditioners 10000 btu comes with a remote control lets you adjust all the settings without getting up from your sofa or bed. Easy to Move Around: The smooth-gliding casters and handles make it a breeze for you to move the portable air conditioner from room to room. So you’ll stay cool and comfortable no matter what room you occupy. Hassle-Free Installation: Simply use the included installation kit and exhaust hose to install the portable air conditioners in a double-hung or sliding window. No professionals or other tools are required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DV4W2iPjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COLZER","source_asin":"B09TSVG69V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1154594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TSVG69V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TSVG69V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
