window.products.push({"id":1154659,"name":"2-Tier Coffee Bar Organizer with K Cup Holder, K Cup Organizer with Coffee Pod Drawer, Coffee Pod Holder for Coffee Storage, Perfect for Coffee Bar Ac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WF96D5uiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕【Coffee Bar Organizer with Coffee Pod Drawer】Are you troubled with the messy countertop for coffee beans, k cups, cups and straws? Don't worry, our K Cup holder has a double layer design. At the bottom of the coffee pods holder is a metal k cup drawer, which is compatible with k cups and will hold up to 30pcs of your favorite pods at a time.The exquisite workmanship of coffee pod holders for k cups makes the drawer easy to push and pull, providing you with a better feeling of use. ☕【Well Organized and Space Saved Coffee Station Organizer】Thanks to the coffee bar accessories and organizer with 2 tier shelves and a coffee pod drawer, the coffee holder with k cup drawer make great storage for your coffee pods, coffee beans, coffee syrup, sugar, coffee cups, paper cups, tea bags, napkins and any other coffee bar essentials. The size of the coffee station organizer for countertop is 13.4”L×10.9”W×16”H(Drawer size: 12.2”L×10.6W×2.3”H), which is very suitable for you to pack more items in less space. ☕【Minimalist Style and Wide Application Coffee Pod Organizer】Our k cup organizer as a kind of coffee bar accessories has a lot of modern minimalist charm, which can be used for decoration and storage of many scenes. For example, you can use the coffee pod organizer for coffee bar accessories and k cup storage in your kitchen, dorm countertop, dining room, pantry or office coffee bar. In addition, the open top design of the countertop organizer makes it easy to access to the items you need. ☕【High Quality Coffee Organizer and Easy to Install】Our stable and durable k cup holders for counter is made of natural solid wood; The bracket on both sides is made of high quality iron and sprayed with high quality paint, which is rust-proof and not easy to fall off.The non-slip rubber pads at bottom can make the coffee bar accessories stay away from water stains. With Pre-drilled holes on each coffee rack wood shelf, it's much easier to attach without measuring, all necessary hardware is included! Install in no time and start right away to organize your coffee station.It's the perfect place to keep all essentials neat and tidy in one spot. ☕【Best Gift Choice and Service Guarantee】Do you want to surprise your family or friends? With charming appearance and storage function, our k cup drawer organizer will be the best gift at housewarming, Thanksgiving day, Christmas or birthday party. Y&ME have always been aiming at providing the best coffee stand. Any issues, please feel free to contact us, and we will provide the best service to you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WF96D5uiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Y&ME YM","source_asin":"B0C2CCBLBT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1154659","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2CCBLBT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2CCBLBT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
