window.products.push({"id":1154804,"name":"Stainless Steel Insulated Coffee Mugs Set of 2 (14oz) – Double Wall Coffee Cups With Spill Resistant Lid & Strong Handle – Shatterproof Cups for Cold ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rBJp-YfGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"5-year Warranty: Here at CHILLOUT LIFE we’re very confident about the superior quality and practicality of our insulated travel mugs. We want you to feel confident, too, when purchasing the sweat proof stainless steel coffee mug set, for this reason we have backed it up with a 5-year warranty & 100% satisfaction guaranteed. If there are ever any issues, simply contact our friendly customer support team and we’ll make it right. A Coffee Mug That You Can Use On The Go: Are you late for work, but you haven’t finished your coffee yet? Then simply seal the stainless steel mug (4 ¾” x 3.5”) with its spill resistant lid to drink it while you commute, drive, and when you arrive to the office! This portable, spill proof mug is a must-have accessory for working adults as well as for travelers, since its rubber lid with the easy-to-use sipping mechanism makes the mugs perfectly portable! Keeps Your Drink At The Right Temperature: These 14oz camp mugs have a powerful double wall vacuum insulation technology that can keep your drinks at the right temperature for hours, much longer than typical ceramic ones, while the outside stays cool to touch! This means that you will be able to enjoy even the very last sip of your coffee and tea, and you will never again have to drink lukewarm water or beer. Robust Construction And Materials: You will never to replace these insulated cups – and why would you? Made with premium quality 18/8 stainless steel, the walls and the comfortable handle of our travel mugs are shatterproof and incredibly durable. Years from now, the insulation of the stainless steel cups will be just as effective, and they will have zero rust and stains. The materials are also BPA free and completely nontoxic, so you have nothing to worry about. The Most Practical Gift For Travelers: Practical gifts are the best kinds of gifts! If you know a tea or coffee lover, a traveler, someone who commutes a lot or someone who enjoys outdoor activities, give them this thermal travel mug set as a gift and rest assured that they will use it every single day! The two eco-friendly, insulated mugs and their spill resistant lids come in a beautiful gift-ready box, so you won’t have to spend money on wrapping paper.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61rBJp-YfGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHILLOUT LIFE","source_asin":"B07S1GYB77","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1154804","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S1GYB77","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S1GYB77","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
