window.products.push({"id":1154844,"name":"Bagotte Robot Vacuum and Mop Combo, 2000Pa Suction 2600 mAh 2 in 1 Mopping Robotic Vacuum Cleaner with Schedule, WiFi/App/Alexa, Self-Charging, No Wat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O83Z-yRtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2-in-1 Vacuum and Mopping】BG550Pro Robot vacuum and mop combo combination can quickly remove dust, paper scraps and pet hair. Equipped with 2-in-1 550ml dust box no water tank design, mop cloth can attached at the dust box bottom which is suitable for all hard floors. Dry and wet two washes, 4 cleaning path modes, meet different cleaning needs, and completely free your hands. 【Smart App & Voice Control】 You can easily create a home clean schedule, change the clean mode, and control the clean direction by using the Bagotte App. The auto vacuum robot is also compatible with Alexa and Google Assistant, allowing users to make the robot start and stop the clean by voice commands. Remote control is also included in the package for your convenience. (⚠The APP only supports 2. 4GHz WiFi.) 【2000PA Suction & Deep Cleaning】 The robot vacuum strong suction up to 2000Pa, 3 levels of adjustable suction, Easily picks up dirt and messes easily from the surface and deep within the carpet. Once a carpet is detected, the BG550Pro increases the suction power to clean the carpet even more thoroughly. The strong suction power of the robotic vacuum cleaner can effectively remove hair, dust, and other particles. 【150mins Runtime & Self-charging】With 2600mAh battery capacity, the robotic vacuum cleaner is a dependable helper for big house cleanings as it offers an extended runtime of 150 minutes, and the maximum cleaning area can reach 1950ft². For a seamless and thorough cleaning cycle, it automatically goes back to the charging dock to recharge and picks up where it left off cleaning. 【Advantaged Brushless Suction Port-No Hair Entanglement Any More】 This robotic vacuum cleaner is powered by a strong digital motor. The robot vacuum has strong suction power and a unique air inlet design, which will not be blocked by pet hair like other robot vacuum cleaners with roller brushes, Ideal for pet families. 【Slim and Quiet Design with Obstacle Avoidance Upgraded Again】 The robot vacuum has advanced precise obstacle avoidance function, a full set of sensors can intelligently identify and avoid white walls, stairs, and obstacles. 2.75'' slim design helps the robot vacuum cleaner to reach every corner of a house or narrow space, clean leftover dirty areas, and keep your house neat.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O83Z-yRtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bagotte","source_asin":"B0C8MWX6QR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1154844","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C8MWX6QR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C8MWX6QR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
