window.products.push({"id":1154934,"name":"GRUNEN WOLKEN Milk Frother Handheld Get Froth in 7 Seconds High Powered Low Noise with Support Stand Electric Milk Coffee drink Mixer Perfect for Coff","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lvAeR-NjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Detachable Head Included] Our electric milk frother is a breakthrough compared to traditional milk frothers. We have developed a unique detachable design that can create multiple functions within a single device. This allows it to serve as both a frother whisk and an egg mixer. The heads are easy to change. It can be used not only to stir ordinary matcha, coffee, cocktails, hot chocolate and fruit drinks, but also to stir thicker liquids, such as milkshakes, protein powders and even eggs. [A New Generation with Stronger Power] Our electric milk coffee blender uses a new generation of technology, it has stronger power and provides a speed of 17000rpm, creating thicker foams in a few seconds. Our handheld milk frother can be used in more mixtures, suitable for all types of milk, as well as creams, soybeans, etc. Besides, the service life time of its motor is almost 3 times longer than others. Our motor can be used for over 300 hours and others can only be used for about 100 hours. [More User-friendly Design] Most of other milk frothers adopt vertical buttons. After investigation, we found that side button is more comfortable and easier to use, so we integrated it into our hand-held electric whisk. Through practical tests, it's proved that this handheld mixer can also provides 4 times longer battery life using 2 AA batteries (not included). After new batteries are installed, it can be used for over 6 hours in total, while others can only be used for around 1.5 hours. [Made of High-quality Materials] Our drink mixer is made of only high-quality materials. The handle we use is non-slip ABS material and the blender portion is made of food-grade 304 stainless steel, which is safe and green. The bracket is also made of stainless steel, which is very stable and sturdy. The electric blender is very easy to clean, you can immerse into water and it will be completely clean in just a few seconds. [Exquisite Set] Our handheld frother is equipped with a stand and an egg beater. The bracket makes it easy to store and does not take up space in your kitchen. The egg beating head is specially used for beating eggs, reducing resistance and prolonging the life of the motor. We offer a lifetime warranty; if you have any questions, please contact us and we will quickly solve it for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lvAeR-NjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ACT FIRE","source_asin":"B08BJX6B9T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1154934","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BJX6B9T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BJX6B9T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
