window.products.push({"id":1154998,"name":"Linego Artificial Wedding Arch Flowers Kit(Pack of 4) - 2pcs Flower Swag with 2pcs 19.7Ft Wedding Arch Draping Fabric Arrangement Swag for Ceremony an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":56.73,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PakZiHlxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌸〖Dimensions of Wedding Arch Flowers Kit〗 Our wedding decorations for ceremony are plentiful which come with 1 * large corner flowers of 80 x 50cm/ 31.5 x 19.6inch + 1 * small corner flowers of 55 x 35cm/ 21.6 x 13.7inch + 2 * chiffon fabric drape of 600 x 75cm/19.7 x 2.46 ft + 5 * white zip straps of 5mmx35cm/0.2 x 13.8 inch( Not Include Wood Stand) 🌹〖Premium Wedding Arch Draping Fabric〗 Our draping fabrics are multipurpose for use in different environments anywhere during your big day. They are made of wrinkle-resistant soft polyester. It is a heavier fabric that is more elegant, soft and flowing than tulle or organza, creating a romantic atmosphere for your wedding. Whenever you use these fabrics, they can always keep smooth and flat which will be more graceful than tulle and nylon fabrics. And it's easy to clean (machine washable) and can be reused for home decor. 🌺〖High Cost Performance of Arch Flowers for Wedding Ceremony〗 Our hanging flowers are lifelike by handmade, never fade or fall. They can stay beautiful outlook forever which symbolizes eternal love, perfect for wedding decoration. They are the best alternative to expensive fresh flowers for wedding decor. Great way of saving money compared to real flowers. 🌻〖Easy to Arrange for Wedding〗 Our wedding arch decorations come with 5 zip straps to help you fix the flowers on the wood stand and you can easily fix these flowers on any base. Suitable for bridal showers, outdoor weddings, beach weddings, garden weddings ceremony , reception backdrop decoration and so on. 🌷〖Artificial Arch Flowers Notes〗The wedding flowers for ceremony might bend a bit due to shipping and packing, please softly knead the petals to help recover the shape. Draping Fabric can machine-washable separately in cold with gentle cycle. Hanging dry and please do not twist. And These wedding arch flowers are handmade, please understand that the size may vary slightly and there might be slightly color difference between silk flowers and foam flowers different dye lots.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PakZiHlxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Linego","source_asin":"B0BBZ57291","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1154998","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBZ57291","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBZ57291","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
