window.products.push({"id":1155000,"name":"Delivering Dreams Turtle Lazy Susan Kitchen Decor - Wooden Turntable Organizer Dining Room Accessories for Table or Countertop Beach House Nautical Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M8ZIIvW0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔ Who doesn't love sea turtles? Expand your home & kitchen decoration options with this delightful conversation piece. Great for everyone who loves turtles. Perfect for anyone with a beach or ocean decor, or who is looking for beach theme or nautical party decorations. ✔ Lovely, but Useful Too! Imagine your kids are preparing their own hamburgers (or anything else), and they have to reach across the table to get what they want to put on their buns. How many times will they knock over the Catsup bottle to reach the pickles? How many times will they drop one food or condiment into another while straining to reach and retrieve something? With a simple spin, this can be avoided. If you think it's handy for a dining room table or kitchen island, imagine how useful it can be on a picnic table at a barbecue! ✔ Be the Perfect Host Whether you use it as a cheese board, to serve hors d'oeuvres, as a snack tray or to display other decorations, your guests will certainly admire this charming turtle design. This Delivering Dreams lazy Susan is a delightful conversation piece you will use again and again. ✔ Built Strong for Years of Service Our lazy Susan is a work of art, but it is also a solid, sturdy turntable that you can use every day. With just a little common-sense care, it will give you years of service. For example, we do not recommend using as a cutting board or butcher block, as that would mark the beauty of the design. It is easy to clean with a washcloth or sponge, but do not soak in water or other liquid, which can damage any natural wood. Do not put in the dishwasher. Includes: One wood lazy Susan laser engraved with charming turtle design. No assembly required. Measures: 15.125 inches (38.41 cm) diameter by 1.5 inches (3.81 cm) tall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81M8ZIIvW0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Delivering Dreams","source_asin":"B09QLFVVCZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1155000","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QLFVVCZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QLFVVCZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
